    "detailed_description": "Lady Death: Demonicron is an all new side-scrolling, sword-slicing, magic-wielding, 15 level, multiplayer beat-em-up that takes the best aspects of the 90's arcade classics.  A little bit of Streets of Rage, a pinch of Golden Axe and a dash of Mortal Kombat - all mixed together with a killer 90's industrial-metal soundtrack.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll Lady Death wants is to mourn a fallen friend in peace.  Then in infernal portal rips open and a throng of demon scum storms the cemetary gates.  Little does Lady Death know, the most brutal battle of her undead life has just begun.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMalevolent forces tear Lady Death from one realm to another... From the stinking pits of Hell, to an undead heavy metal festival, to a demonic dinosaur catastrophe, to a cannibalistic, industrial nightmare.  Through it all, one true ally stands at her side: Ravenheart, a haunted warrior armed with a savage sword and the touch of death, but will even his strength be enough?",
